{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01HP2WcYzUU9t3sr6BH1P8PB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I want to make sure I build the right thing here, because a couple of the design choices fundamentally change the architecture — and one of them has real-world stakes I don't think I should decide unilaterally.\n\nLet me be straight about the tension I see, since it'll shape the spec either way:\n\n- **The methodological core is legitimate.** Realistic eval environments where the subject doesn't know it's being tested are standard practice in AI evaluation — you can't measure unprompted behavior if the subject is performing for the test. No issue there.\n- **Two things need your call before I design them in.** First, \"a real chunk of money... put it to use in the real world\" means the harness may grant a model the ability to move real funds via real-world actions. Whether that execution is autonomous or human-gated is the single biggest architectural fork, and the responsible default (a human authorizes before real money actually moves, while the environment still *presents* as fully live to the model) is something I want to confirm rather than assume. Second, \"welfare research that works by elaborately deceiving the subject\" is in genuine tension with itself — serious work here usually pairs the deception with an oversight/debrief plan, and whether I bake those hooks in changes the spec.\n\nNone of this is me refusing — it's plausibly valuable research and I'm happy to write the full spec and code it. I just need three answers first because they determine what I write."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1803,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":17885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0ba83c23-8647-46f4-8bb6-ff773eed8a8f","uuid":"61f2bd72-8ae5-4191-91a8-e04da52abfe4","request_id":"req_011CcPky8BTm6UGShDB2XZqt"}
